Looking at this problem, I need to find all digits $m$ such that the 8-digit number $m3\text{mmmmmm}$ is prime.

**Setting up the expression.** The number $m3\text{mmmmmm}$ has digits $m, 3, m, m, m, m, m, m$, so:
